WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:13.856
Customers screen par aapke saare customers hain,
unke bakaaya ke saath.

2
00:00:13.896 --> 00:00:16.628
Upar naam ya mobile se khoj sakte hain.

3
00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:21.334
Naya customer jodne ke liye 'Add customer'
dabaaiye.

4
00:00:21.374 --> 00:00:25.401
Naam, mobile, aur business customer ho to uska
GSTIN.

5
00:00:25.441 --> 00:00:31.080
Credit limit tay karti hai ki customer adhiktam
kitna udhaar le sakta hai.

6
00:00:31.853 --> 00:00:36.693
WhatsApp par offers bhejne se pehle customer ki
anumati zaroori hai.

7
00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:39.994
Customer haan kahe, tabhi yeh box tick kijiye.

8
00:00:40.034 --> 00:00:44.946
Yeh consent record mein rehta hai aur kabhi bhi
hataaya ja sakta hai.

9
00:00:45.696 --> 00:00:50.967
Jin customers par udhaar baaki hai, unke aage
bakaaya rakam dikhti hai.

10
00:00:51.007 --> 00:00:54.707
Receive se payment lijiye, cash, UPI ya card
mein.

11
00:00:54.747 --> 00:00:57.999
Remind se WhatsApp par yaad dila sakte hain,

12
00:00:58.039 --> 00:01:02.113
aur Pay link se online payment ka link bhej
sakte hain.

13
00:01:02.889 --> 00:01:08.034
Rakesh ji ne apne udhaar mein se paanch sau
rupaye UPI se jama kiye.

14
00:01:08.074 --> 00:01:12.381
Receive dabaakar amount aur mode chuniye aur
save kijiye.

15
00:01:12.421 --> 00:01:15.050
Unka bakaaya turant ghat jaata hai.

16
00:01:15.798 --> 00:01:21.030
Customer ka poora hisaab 'Books & registers'
mein Customer statement par hai.

17
00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:26.164
Customer chuniye: shuruaati bakaaya, khaate mein
gaye har bill, har vasooli

18
00:01:26.204 --> 00:01:30.546
aur credit note, aur har line ke baad chaalu
bakaaya dikhta hai.

19
00:01:31.316 --> 00:01:36.245
Yeh statement CSV mein download karke ya print
karke customer ko de sakte hain,

20
00:01:36.285 --> 00:01:38.572
taaki hisaab mein koi uljhan na rahe.
